                        585</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d1222-f3" n="3" xml:id="d1222-f3-content">
                <p>See the attachment to <ref target="#d1217">document No. 1217</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d1222-f4" n="4" xml:id="d1222-f4-content">
                <p><ref target="#d1218">Document No. 1218</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d1222-f5" n="5" xml:id="d1222-f5-content">
                <p>Byrnes took no action on this recommendation during the Berlin Conference.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
